<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to DesiLynks</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f7f8ff;
      color: #3b465b;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    }
    table {
      border-spacing: 0;
      mso-table-lspace: 0pt;
      mso-table-rspace: 0pt;
    }
    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      table-layout: fixed;
      background-color: #f7f8ff;
    }
    .email-container {
      padding: 48px 24px 64px;
    }
    .main {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e8ecf5;
      border-collapse: separate;
      border-radius: 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(40, 59, 105, 0.06);
    }
    .header {
      padding: 32px 40px 28px;
      text-align: center;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-top: 4px solid #2563eb;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #edf0f7;
      border-radius: 23px 23px 0 0;
    }
    .header-logo {
      margin: 0;
      color: #2563eb;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.25;
      letter-spacing: -0.6px;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 36px 40px 40px;
      color: #3b465b;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.75;
      text-align: left;
      overflow-wrap: break-word;
    }
    .content p {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
    }
    .content p:first-child {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: #273449;
      font-size: 18px;
    }
    .content p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .content strong {
      color: #273449;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .footer {
      padding: 24px 40px;
      background-color: #f8faff;
      border-top: 1px solid #edf0f7;
      border-radius: 0 0 23px 23px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .footer p {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }
    .footer p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: #738095;
    }

    .features-list {
      margin: 24px 0 28px;
      padding: 24px 24px 24px 44px;
      background-color: #f5f8ff;
      border: 1px solid #e2eaff;
      border-radius: 18px;
      color: #3b465b;
    }
    .features-list li {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      padding-left: 4px;
    }
    .features-list li:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .features-list li::marker {
      color: #2563eb;
    }
    .content p:last-child {
      color: #2563eb;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
  </style>
  <style data-css-inline="keep">
    @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
      .email-container {
        padding: 24px 12px 36px !important;
      }
      .main {
        border-radius: 20px !important;
      }
      .header {
        padding: 28px 24px 24px !important;
        border-radius: 19px 19px 0 0 !important;
      }
      .header-logo {
        font-size: 26px !important;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 28px 24px 32px !important;
        font-size: 15px !important;
      }
      .footer {
        padding: 22px 24px !important;
        border-radius: 0 0 19px 19px !important;
      }
      .otp-code {
        padding: 18px 20px 18px 26px !important;
        font-size: 28px !important;
        letter-spacing: 6px !important;
      }
      .features-list {
        padding: 20px 18px 20px 36px !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color: #f7f8ff;">
      <tr>
        <td class="email-container" align="center">
          <table class="main" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation">
            <tr>
              <td class="header">
                <h1 class="header-logo">DesiLynks 🎉</h1>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="content">
                <p>Hello <strong>{{fullName}}</strong>,</p>
                <p>Your email has been successfully verified. Welcome to the DesiLynks community!</p>
                <p>We're thrilled to have you on board. Here are some of the things you can do to get started:</p>
                
                <ul class="features-list">
                  <li><strong>Create your professional profile:</strong> Let others know who you are and what you do.</li>
                  <li><strong>Chat with other users:</strong> Expand your network and make meaningful connections.</li>
                  <li><strong>Explore the marketplace:</strong> Buy, sell, or trade items securely.</li>
                  <li><strong>Jobs & Opportunities:</strong> Post job openings or find your next career move.</li>
                  <li><strong>Housing & Properties:</strong> Find rooms to rent or list your own properties.</li>
                </ul>
                
                <p>We're excited to see what you achieve with DesiLynks.</p>
                <p>Happy Connecting!</p>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="footer">
                <p>Thank you for choosing DesiLynks.</p>
                <p>&copy; 2026 DesiLynks. All rights reserved.</p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</body>
</html>